{"last_link_id": 5, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# IndexTTS 2.5 长文本语音克隆 · 使用说明\n\n## 输入\n- 音色参考：5~15 秒干净人声（无背景音乐、无多人、无喷麦），wav/flac/mp3 均可；越干净，克隆还原度越高\n- 长文本：直接粘贴整段文本（剧本/旁白/解说），自动分段生成，段落间静音 350ms 可调\n\n## 参数（默认已调优，追求稳定音色）\n- temperature 0.7 / top_p 0.85：随机性适中，避免音色飘移\n- repetition_penalty 1.1：正常防重复范围（10.0 为极端值会导致措辞生硬）\n- 分段：每段 ≤120 字（max_text_tokens_per_segment），段间 350ms 静音\n- max_mel_tokens 3000：单段音频上限，长文本自动分段不受限\n\n## 常用调节\n- 语速：duration_factor >1 更慢、<1 更快（0.5~2.0）\n- 语言：中文配音选 ZH；支持 EN / JA / ES / AR\n- 种子：固定种子可复现；randomize 每次随机\n- 情感：接线情感节点可控制情绪（高兴/愤怒/悲伤/害怕/厌恶/忧郁/惊讶/平静）\n\n## 输出\n- SaveAudio 节点，默认 video-pros/indextts25_long，MP3/WAV 可选"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [560, 460], "pos": [-308.5790100097656, -365.0948181152344], "id": 7, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "生成音频", "links": [4], "label": "生成音频", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "生成音频"}, {"name": "生成信息", "links": [], "label": "生成信息", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "生成信息"}], "size": [470, 390], "pos": [1197.934326171875, -178.92930603027344], "widgets_values": ["", "ZH", 1, 782587423964574, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 1, "label": "model", "type": "T8_INDEXTTS25_MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"name": "speaker_audio", "link": 2, "label": "speaker_audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "speaker_audio"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "emotion", "label": "emotion", "type": "T8_INDEXTTS25_EMOTION", "localized_name": "emotion"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "sampling", "link": 3, "label": "sampling", "type": "T8_INDEXTTS25_SAMPLING", "localized_name": "sampling"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 5, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "language"}, "name": "language", "label": "language", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "lang